  m_text: 'This is a simple game that uses only two 6 sided dice and determines its
    result based on the sum of these two dice.

    There is a variety of items you
    can bet on. As long as the sum of your dice matches the item number,

    you
    win prizes.

    If the outcome of any round cannot be determined due to malfunction,
    the round will be deemed as invalid.

    Malfunctions void all pays and plays.
    If a malfunction occurs during a game, the system will automatically complete
    the game and award the player.

    It a disconnection ocours after receiving
    the player''s bet and the player can no longer influence the outoome, the bet
    result remains valid.'
